==Battleground==
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*4 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Cadaver Bear]] spawns after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Bears Be Back]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Generic rusher units clears this stage easily. For Cadaver Bear, add [[Shigong Cat]] to wall him while [[Seafarer Cat]] is good for Ursamajor. Use the default Cannon for the Assassin Bear jumpscare and you win.

